---
import SectionHeading from './SectionHeading.astro';
---

<section class="section section-tinted" id="experience" aria-labelledby="experience-title">
  <div class="container section-grid">
    <SectionHeading number="02" title="Experience" description="서비스를 만들고 운영하며 쌓은 경험" id="experience-title" />
    <div class="section-body timeline">
      <article class="timeline-item">
        <div class="timeline-meta"><span class="timeline-date">2022.03 — Present</span><span class="current-badge">CURRENT</span></div>
        <h3><a href="https://www.nts-corp.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">N Tech Service <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></h3>
        <p class="role">Software Engineer</p>
        <p class="item-intro">내부 서비스의 안정적인 운영을 위한 데이터베이스 및 접근 제어 업무를 담당합니다.</p>
        <ul class="detail-list">
          <li>DB Object 관리 및 전산원장 DML 승인</li>
          <li>ACG / ACL 정책 관리</li>
          <li>실시간 서버 메트릭 모니터링 및 알림</li>
        </ul>
      </article>
      <article class="timeline-item">
        <div class="timeline-meta"><span class="timeline-date">2021.03 — 2022.03</span></div>
        <h3><a href="https://www.i-screamedu.co.kr/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">i-Scream Edu <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></h3>
        <p class="role">Backend Developer</p>
        <p class="item-intro">선생님, 학부모, 학생을 연결하는 <a class="text-link" href="https://www.hiclass.net/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">HiClass <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a> 서비스의 백엔드 개발에 참여했습니다.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
